('alict_00234', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'Simplify the given logic gate statement. ,nd', '["CD + DB", "BC\u0305", "C\u0305D + DB", "C\u0305 + CB", "CD + DBC"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "CD + DB". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 2027, 234, '2027 Quiz Series'),
