('alict_00243', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'Which correct answer contains SOP and POS equations which can be obtained by below Karnaugh map respectively?', '["(A + C) + B , (B + C).(A. B)", "(A. C) + B , (B + C). (A + B)", "(B. C + A. B) , (A. C) + B", "A , (A + B). (B + C)", "(A + C).B , (B + C) + (A + B)"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "(A. C) + B , (B + C). (A + B)". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 2027, 243, '2027 Quiz Series'),
