('alict_00245', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'A. C̅̅̅̅̅ ⊕ 0̅. A̅̅̅̅̅̅ Solve this boolean expression', '["A + C", "A. C\u0305", "A \u0305 + C", "A\u0305", "1"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "A ̅ + C". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 2027, 245, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00246', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'Consider an SR latch built with NOR gates. If the inputs are S = 0 and R = 0, and the previous state of Q was 1, what will be the current state of Q and Q̅?', '["Q = 1, Q\u0305 = 0", "Q = 0, Q\u0305 = 1", "Q = 1, Q\u0305 = 1", "Invalid state", "Cannot be determined"]'::jsonb, 1, 'An SR latch is a basic memory element built using logic gates. It has two S (Set) and R (Reset), and two Q and Q̅ , where Q̅ is the logical complement of Q. The behavior of the latch depends on the combination of the S and R inputs', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 2027, 246, '2027 Quiz Series'),
