('alict_00264', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'What is the output of the full adder A = 0, B = 1 and Cin = 1?', '["Sum = 0, Cout = 0", "Sum = 1, Cout = 0", "Sum = 0, Cout = 1", "Sum = 1, Cout = 1", "None of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The full adder calculates the sum and carry out using following A ⊕ B ⊕ Cin (XOR operation) (A . B) + (B . Cin) + (A . Cin) (OR of the AND conditions) Step by step calculation 1.A = 0, B = 1, Cin = 1 2', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 2027, 264, '2027 Quiz Series'),
