('alict_00482', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is external fragmentation?', '["Unused memory within allocated blocks. fjka", "Unused memory between allocated blocks that can''t be used", "Memory that is not freed properly after use", "Memory corruption due to improper allocation. wksis", "None of the above"]'::jsonb, 2, 'External fragmentation occurs when memory is allocated in but the free memory between these allocated blocks becomes unusable due to its fragmentation into smaller pieces. Over as memory is allocated and small gaps are created between allocated blocks', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 482, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00483', 12, 'General ICT', 'LED monitors achieve greater energy efficiency LED fudksgr', '["They do not require individual transistors for each pixel", "They use light-emitting diodes as their primary light source. Tjqka Tjqkaf.a m%Odk", "They rely on electron beam which minimizes energy loss", "They utilize liquid crystals without a backlight. Tjqka", "They are made of entirely biodegradable materials"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Option 1: Incorrect. LED monitors require individual transistors as part of their especially in pixel-based displays like OLED or active-matrix LED displays. OLED active-matrix LED Option 2: Correct', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 483, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00484', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which method of user authentication is most commonly used in modern operating systems?', '["Username and password", "Eye retina scan", "Signature recognition", "Fingerprint recognition", "V oice recognition"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Username and password A commonly used method of user authentication in modern operating systems. It is simple and widely implemented in various systems and despite having security limitations', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 484, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00485', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following OS types is designed to prevent downtime or delays in critical applications?', '["single-task", "multi-task", "Real-time", "Time-sharing", "Multi-threading"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The operating system type specifically designed to prevent downtime or delays in critical applications is the Real-time Operating System (RTOS). Real-time systems are essential in environments where timing is such as embedded industrial and medical devices', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 485, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00486', 12, 'General ICT', 'What does the physical view of a file refer to?', '["The file''s extension", "How the file is stored on secondary storage", "The file''s owner", "The access permissions of the file", "The logical structure of the file"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The physical view of a file refers to how the file is stored on secondary storage devices like hard drives or This view focuses on the actual location of the file''s data on the storage including how it''s broken down into blocks or sectors', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 486, '2027 Quiz Series'),
