('alict_00763', 2, 'Number Systems & Data Representation', 'What is the primary advantage of using 2''s complement representation for signed integers?', '["It allows for easier implementation of arithmetic operations. th wxl", "It simplifies the hardware needed for multiplication", "It provides a more efficient way to store floating-point numbers. th", "It makes the conversion between binary and decimal systems easier. th", "None of the above"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Option 1: This option highlights the key advantage of 2''s complement. It simplifies the design of arithmetic allowing the same addition and subtraction processes to be used for both signed and unsigned making calculations more efficient', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Number Systems & Data Representation', 2027, 763, '2027 Quiz Series'),
