('alict_01423', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'What will be the POS (Product of Sum) expression in the given Karnaugh map?', '["(B\u0305 + C + D). (A + B + D\u0305). (A\u0305 + B + C\u0305 + D). (A\u0305 + B\u0305 + C\u0305 + D\u0305)", "(B + C\u0305 + D). (A + B + D). (A\u0305 + B + C + D). (A\u0305 + B\u0305 + C + D\u0305)", "(B\u0305 + C\u0305 + D). (B + D\u0305). (A\u0305 + C\u0305 + D). (A\u0305 + B + C\u0305 + D\u0305)", "(B\u0305 + C ). (A + B + D\u0305). (A\u0305C\u0305 + D). (A + B\u0305 + C\u0305 + D\u0305)", "(B\u0305 + D). (A + B + D). (A\u0305 + B + C + D). (A\u0305 + B\u0305 + C\u0305 + D)"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "(B̅ + C + D). (A + B + D̅). (A̅ + B + C̅ + D). (A̅ + B̅ + C̅ + D̅)". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1423, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
