('alict_01445', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'What is the Boolean expression that can be obtain from the below logic circuit?', '["121", "721", "65", "56", "87"]'::jsonb, 4, 'write the Boolean expression of the logic circuit. Z = (A + B)(A + B)A̅ this Boolean expression can be simplified as follows. = (A + B)(A + B)A̅ = (A + B)A̅ Idempotent law = AA ̅ + A̅B Distributive law = 0 + A̅B Inverse law = A̅B Identity law', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1445, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
