('alict_01449', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'What is the Boolean expression that can be obtained from the below logic ,nd.; yels 1) Explanation', '["CC + C(D\u0305B\u0305 + AB\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305)", "C + A(D\u0305B\u0305 + AB\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305)", "C + A(D\u0305A\u0305 + AB\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305)", "BC + A(D\u0305B\u0305 + AB\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305)", "AC + A(D\u0305B\u0305 + AB\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305) 4"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "CC + C(D̅B̅ + AB̅̅̅̅)". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1449, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
