('alict_01473', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'A. B̅ ⊕ A. B. C̅ Solve this boolean expression. fuu 4) This Boolean expression can be simplified as follows. fuu yelsh'' AB̅ ⊕ ABC̅ AB̅̅̅̅̅. ABC̅ + AB̅. ABC̅̅̅̅̅̅̅ A ⊕ B = A̅B + AB̅ (A̅ + B̿). ABC̅ + AB̅. ABC̅̅̅̅̅̅̅ De Morgan''s law', '["A. B + C\u0305", "A. B. C\u0305 + A. C", "B. C + C\u0305. A", "A. B\u0305 + A. C\u0305", "A. B\u0305. C ABC\u0305 + AB\u0305A\u0305 + AB\u0305B\u0305 + AB\u0305C Idempotent law"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Correct answer: "A. B̅ + A. C̅". This follows from evaluating the given Boolean expression / logic circuit using standard gate truth tables and Boolean algebra rules.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1473, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01474', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'CAC̅̅̅̅̅̅ + BB̅̿̿̿̿ What is the answer when the above Boolean expression is trivialized?', '["B\u0305\u033f", "AC\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305 + 0", "CA\u0305\u0305\u0305\u0305", "1", "0"]'::jsonb, 4, 'This Boolean expression can be simplified as follows. CAC̅ ̅̅̅̅̅̅ + BB̅̿̿̿̿ CAC̅ ̅̅̅̅̅̅ + BB̅ Inverse Law C̅ + A̅ + C̅̅ + BB̅ Demorgan Law C̅ + A̅ + C + BB̅ Inverse Law A̅ + BB̅ + 1 Complement Law 1 Identity Law', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1474, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
