('alict_01476', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'How many NAND gates are required to implement only the Sum output of a Full Adder?', '["4", "8", "9", "10", "12"]'::jsonb, 4, 'The Sum output of a full adder is given by Sum = A ⊕ B ⊕ Cin This means the sum is the XOR of three which we usually break down into two XOR operations', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1476, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
