('alict_01999', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'How does artificial intelligence contribute to day-to-day activities in modern technology?', '["By replacing manual labor entirely", "By automating routine tasks and providing intelligent assistance", "By eliminating the need for human input", "By increasing the complexity of user interfaces", "By solely improving physical product design"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "By automating routine tasks and providing intelligent assistance". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', NULL, 1999, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02000', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'A country''s citizens can renew their passports through an official government website by submitting forms and making online payments. Which e-commerce model does this represent?', '["B2B", "C2C", "B2C", "G2C", "C2B"]'::jsonb, 4, 'G2C e-commerce refers to the use of online platforms where governments provide services directly to citizens. These services can include paying renewing applying for or in this renewing passports', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', NULL, 2000, 'A/L Past Paper Series')
