('alict_02061', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'Which of the following is a characteristic of an open system?', '["It operates without any interaction with its environment. th tys", "It is completely self-contained and does not exchange energy with its surroundings. th", "It continuously interacts with its exchanging energy and information. th", "It is isolated from external influences and functions independently. th", "It can only be a manmade system. th"]'::jsonb, 3, 'An open system is one that continuously interacts with its surroundings by exchanging or information. This interaction with the environment allows the system to and respond to external making it dynamic and flexible', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2061, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02062', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'What is the primary function of an information broker', '["Facilitating online transactions", "Providing entertainment content", "Collecting and selling data to other businesses", "Offering cloud storage solutions", "Delivering packages to consumers"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "Collecting and selling data to other businesses". This follows from the standard definitions of data, information, and ICT processing concepts.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2062, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02063', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'A tech startup needs to quickly deploy and scale virtual servers for hosting their web application without investing in physical hardware. They choose to use Amazon EC2 to rent virtual machines and manage their storage and networking. What type of cloud service are they using?', '["(Infrastructure as a Service", "(Software as a Service", "(Platform as a Service", "(Data as a Service", "(Backend as a Service"]'::jsonb, 1, '1) (Infrastructure as a Service Provides virtualized computing resources (like and networking) over the internet. 2) (Software as a Service Delivers software applications over the managed by the service provider', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2063, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02064', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'Choose the correct statement about connectors used for data transmission', '["M12 connectors are used to connect twisted pairs M12", "BNC connectors are used to connect the coaxial cable iudlaIl", "RJ45 connectors are used to connect fiber optics", "M12 connectors are used to connect the coaxial cable iudlaIl", "RJ45 connectors are used to connect the coaxial cable iudlaIl"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Option 1: This statement is incorrect. M12 connectors are typically used in industrial particularly for sensor and actuator and are not specifically designed for twisted pair cables. Twisted pair cables are more commonly associated with RJ45 connectors', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', NULL, 2064, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
