('alict_02501', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'oct(bin(145)) What is the correct output of the above Python calculation?', '["221", "10010001", "0o221", "0b10010001", "syntax error 14510 27 26 25 24 23 22 21 20 128 64 32 16 8 4 2 1 0 1 0 1 100100012 7"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "221". Trace through the code line by line (variable assignments, loop iterations, and function calls) to confirm this result.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2501, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
