('alict_02516', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'What is the purpose of the action attribute in an form?', '["It specifies the form''s target audience th fmdarufha", "It defines the CSS styles to apply to the form th fmdaruhg", "It sets the URL where the form data should be th fmdaru", "It sets the data validation rules th", "It defines the programming language used in the form. th fmdarufha"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The action attribute in an form defines the URL where the form data will be sent when the user submits the form. It points to a server-side script or application that processes the submitted such as saving it in a database or sending it via email', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2516, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
