('alict_02523', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'Which of the following is a characteristic of a low-level programming language?', '["It is easy for humans to read and write", "It uses abstract concepts and is highly portable across different platforms. th", "It provides direct access to memory and making it fast and efficient. th", "It requires an interpreter to execute the code", "Examples include Python and Java"]'::jsonb, 3, 'This is a key characteristic of a low -level programming language (like Assembly language or Machine code). They offer fine -grained control over the computer''s leading to highly optimized and efficient though at the cost of complexity', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2523, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
