('alict_02541', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'Which of the following is a dependency management tool for PHP in web development?', '["Notepad is a basic text editor that comes pre-installed on Windows with a simple interface. Notepad", "Notepad++ Notepad++ is an open-source text editor for Windows that offers advanced features beyond basic Notepad. Notepad++", "Composer is an application-level dependency manager for PHP web development that manages libraries and dependencies. It ensures that all components are correctly versioned and aiding in the integration of PHP frameworks and third-party packages. Composer", "Sublime text Sublime Text is a powerful code editor widely used in web development due to its and efficiency in web development. Sublime Text", "Visual Studio Code VS Code is a WYSIWYG (What You See Is What You Get) editor which is great for those without technical skills. VS Code"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "Notepad is a basic text editor that comes pre-installed on Windows with a simple interface. Notepad". Trace through the code line by line (variable assignments, loop iterations, and function calls) to confirm this result.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2541, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
