('alict_02630', 8, 'Web Development', 'What is the purpose of the <form> tag in', '["To link pages", "To format text", "To define a section of a document", "To collect user input", "To style tables"]'::jsonb, 4, 'The It typically contains various input elements like text radio and submit buttons. The data entered by the user is sent to a server for processing when the form is submitted', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Web Development', NULL, 2630, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
